---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About — Swad Khan HTB Writeups">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:720px;">
      <h2 class="section-title">About</h2>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          I'm <strong>Swad Mustasin Khan</strong> — a cybersecurity researcher and red-team
          enthusiast. By day I work on privacy-preserving machine learning for critical
          infrastructure as a research assistant; by night I break machines on Hack The Box.
        </p>
        <p>
          This site is where I publish full writeups for <strong>retired</strong> HTB machines:
          the reconnaissance, the foothold, the privilege escalation, and the reasoning at each
          step. My focus is on <em>methodology</em> — how I enumerate, where I get stuck, and how I
          think my way to root — not just copy-paste commands.
        </p>
        <h3># Why only retired machines?</h3>
        <p>
          Hack The Box's rules permit publishing solutions only for retired content. Publishing
          walkthroughs for active machines violates their Terms of Service. So every writeup here is
          for a machine I've confirmed is officially retired. Machines I've owned that are still
          active are listed as <em>owned</em>, with their writeups withheld until retirement.
        </p>
        <h3># Elsewhere</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="https://app.hackthebox.com/users/2602750" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Hack The Box profile</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://portfolio-swad.vercel.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Main portfolio</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/swad-khan-196a68251/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
